  Content: "An Armican multinational technology conglomerate, known for their research
    and development of the Typocrypha. \n\nOstanes was founded by current CEO Austin
    Steiner as a company specializing in networking devices. Steiner's early investment
    in the colonization of the city of Agartha would lead to the expansion of their
    business into research of magical computing devices, solidfying themselves as
    a pioneer in the space."
